' F5 -- Conceptual domain model.
' Chapter 3 (Requirements). UML class diagram.
' Claim supported: the domain vocabulary and its multiplicities, at analysis
' level. Deliberately distinct from F9/F9b (the physical ER schema) -- this one
' names concepts, including two (Quiz, Idea) that have no table behind them,
' and one (Space) that generalises a table (courses) and a user's own uploads.
' Layout: -left-/-right- and [hidden] only keep boxes in place; statement
' order matters to the layout engine, so reorder with care.
@startuml f5-domain-model
!include _style.iuml

title Conceptual domain model

hide methods
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 10
skinparam ranksep 22

class User {
  role : student/professor/admin
}
class Note
class LearnerMemory {
  kind : preference/shaky/strong/goal
}

class Space <<abstract>> {
  title
}
class Course {
  status : draft/published
}
class PersonalSpace
class Lecture {
  visibility : course/private_student
}
class Embedding {
  vector : 768
}
class Slide {
  slideNumber
  needsReview
}
class Quiz <<derived>> #DCDCDC
class Idea <<derived>> #DCDCDC
class Question {
  options[4], correctAnswer
}
class Concept

class LunaSession {
  status : active/wrapped/abandoned
  turns : Turn [0..*]
}
class ReviewCard {
  owner : User [0..1]
}
class Attempt <<abstract>>
class ReviewGrade {
  rating : 1..4
}
class QuizAttempt
class ExamAttempt

' --- Spaces and the learner ---
Space <|-- Course
PersonalSpace -right-|> Space
User "1" -left- "0..*" LearnerMemory : < about

User "1" -- "0..*" Note : writes >
User "1" -- "0..*" Space : owns >
User "1" -- "0..*" LunaSession : studies in >
User "1" -- "0..*" Attempt : performs >
Space "1" -- "0..*" LunaSession : < in

User "0..*" -- "0..*" Course : joins >
Attempt <|-- ReviewGrade
Attempt <|-- QuizAttempt
Attempt <|-- ExamAttempt

' --- content and activity ---
PersonalSpace -[hidden]- Lecture
Space "0..1" -- "0..*" Lecture : holds >
Embedding "0..*" -right- "1" Lecture : vectorises >
Note "0..*" -- "0..1" Lecture : anchored to >
LunaSession "0..*" -- "0..1" Lecture : on >
ReviewGrade "0..*" -- "1" ReviewCard : grades >
LunaSession "0..1" -- "0..*" ReviewCard : makes >

Lecture "1" -- "1..*" Slide : contains >
Quiz .right. Slide : //derived//
Slide .right. Idea : //derived//
Slide "0..*" -- "0..*" Concept : teaches >
Slide "1" -- "0..*" Question : tests >
ReviewCard "0..*" -- "0..1" Question : made from >
QuizAttempt "0..*" -- "1" Question : answers >
ExamAttempt "0..*" -- "1..*" Question : draws >

note bottom of Quiz
  «derived» = no table. A Quiz is the
  Questions reachable via a Lecture's
  Slides; an Idea is a run of Slides an
  LLM groups on demand, only cached.
end note

note bottom of Concept
  Write-idle by default: ingestion
  is gated by FEATURE_COURSE_BRAIN
  (off), so no Slide teaches one.
end note

legend bottom
  Analysis-level model: names the domain, not the tables (compare F9).
  A ReviewCard comes from a Question or from a LunaSession; only the
  latter has an owner.
endlegend

@enduml
